/-!
# B5 `J` side, part K31: the entries of the `J` table are bounded

`jTab_bnd`: from the shapes and bounds `PartD` of a line (at any kernel precision `k'`), every
entry of `tabsT (fun _ => jTab P kJ K G fs bs cc) 1` has `zsz ≤ B` once `Xb ≤ B`, `Bc + 4 ≤ B`,
`kJ + 1 ≤ B` and `P + 2 ≤ B`.
-/

